# What each row's condition needs, so that two rows that can never fail together
# are known: a reordering of such rows changes no answer, and no corpus can
# show it. A value lists the alternatives with "|"; two rows are exclusive when
# a key they share has no alternative in common. Keys: op (the
# challenge_operation), reg (locked or held), held (the presented challenge),
# aid (an enrol approver ID tombstoned or not), cand (lan or phone), auth (an
# authorizing credential found or not), doc (the revocation document well
# formed or not), signer (the anchor its key is), rev (against
# last_external_revision).
